Hi {Owner},

I build websites for roofing companies across the region around {City}. {Business Name} clearly runs a lot of storm and replacement work from several offices, but the site sends storm ads to the homepage, has no page for most of the cities you cover and routes every inspection request through one form.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting: a storm and claim guide, a page per city tied to the office that covers it, inspection requests routed to the nearest office, a commercial roofing section and a careers page for reps and crews, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It connects to the sales system your reps already use. The build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and storm pages.

Worth twenty minutes with you and your marketing lead?

